# 跨平台换行符与二进制声明
# 背景：本仓在 Windows（core.autocrlf=true）与 macOS/Linux 之间切换，此前缺少此文件，
#       新建 md 时反复出现 "LF will be replaced by CRLF" 告警。

# 默认：文本由 git 自动识别，入库统一 LF，检出时按平台转换
* text=auto

# 明确文本类型
*.md   text
*.html text
*.css  text
*.js   text
*.json text
*.toml text
*.yaml text
*.yml  text
*.py   text
*.c    text
*.h    text
*.cpp  text
*.hpp  text
*.rs   text
*.s    text
*.ll   text
*.td   text
CMakeLists.txt text
Makefile       text

# 脚本必须是 LF，否则在 Linux/macOS 上执行会报 bad interpreter
*.sh  text eol=lf

# 二进制，禁止任何转换
*.pdb binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz  binary
*.tar binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
